cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Obelos in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Obelos: CI for agent context"
type: software
version: 0.1.0-alpha.0
date-released: 2026-10-05
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Episteme-Research-Studio/obelos"
url: "https://github.com/Episteme-Research-Studio/obelos"
abstract: >-
  Obelos is a deterministic, offline command-line tool that lints and scores
  the instruction files that AI coding agents read (CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md,
  Cursor rules, Copilot instructions, GEMINI.md), checking their claims against
  the repository they describe.
keywords:
  - agent instructions
  - AGENTS.md
  - CLAUDE.md
  - linter
  - continuous integration
  - ContextOps
authors:
  - family-names: Hakszer
    given-names: Denis
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3354-7315"
    affiliation: "Episteme Research Studio"
